<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Evaluating Robustness of Vision-Language Models Under Noisy
Conditions

<br class="ltx_break">
<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>Identify applicable funding agency here. If none, delete this.</span></span></span></h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">1<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">st</sup> Purushoth Velayuthan
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
