<span id="Sx1.T3.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Sx1.T3.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Less Descriptive Captions (Flickr)</span></span>
